# FlowStack has no root .env file. Each app documents its own variables:
#   apps/server/.env.example      API (confidential values; or use Infisical)
#   apps/web/.env.example         React Router frontend (public VITE_* values)
#   apps/tanstack/.env.example    TanStack Start frontend (public VITE_* values)
# The complete list, with required/optional/integration flags, is
# scripts/lib/env-manifest.mjs. `bun run setup` creates the files you need.
